<v Daniel>pretty nice, honestly.</v>

5
00:00:20.573 --> 00:00:34.602
<v Maya>Right. But today we are tailoring this dive specifically for you, the listener, to cut through that exact kind of Silicon Valley hype. Because for the last couple of years, the narrative around generative AI has sounded exactly like those old magazines.</v>

