7
00:00:35.723 --> 00:00:50.692
<v Maya>We've been sold this idea of a digital tidal wave, you know, something that is just going to wash away half the jobs in the economy overnight. So our mission today is to completely ignore what artificial intelligence could do. In theory, we are looking at the hard data of what it is</v>

