69
00:06:41.414 --> 00:06:46.876
<v Daniel>Right. Randomly fabricated survey answers would show wild fluctuations, but this data remained highly consistent.</v>

70
00:06:47.298 --> 00:06:55.103
<v Maya>Okay, so assuming the thermometer is reading consistently, let's look at what it's actually telling us about the economy as of May 2026. Let's</v>

71
00:06:55.263 --> 00:06:55.484
