90
00:08:46.031 --> 00:08:52.456
<v Maya>Well, sure. I mean, you can't use an algorithmic chat bot to cut someone's hair or serve a table or, you know, drive a forklift.</v>

91
00:08:52.636 --> 00:09:05.966
<v Daniel>Right. And the task data perfectly mirrors those physical limitations. The top tasks, the ones seeing 55 to 61 percent adoption, are reading and preparing reports, developing models, and analyzing data.</v>

