100
00:09:41.219 --> 00:09:55.988
<v Maya>Right. That means they are entirely missing the long tail of niche, weird things people do at work. If AI is being heavily utilized for a worker's 15th most important task, like maybe some obscure weekly scheduling duty,</v>

