105
00:10:12.261 --> 00:10:19.808
<v Maya>Still, I mean, even with that caveat, this shallow puddle reality is a massive departure from the panic of a few years ago.</v>

106
00:10:19.828 --> 00:10:20.849
<v Daniel>Oh, completely.</v>

107
00:10:21.209 --> 00:10:30.457
