00:10:39.879 --> 00:10:54.482
<v Daniel>Over the last few years, teams led by Taina Alundo, who published the famous GPTs are GPTs paper at OpenAI, along with researchers like Ed Felton, Michael Webb, and the team of Eric Brynjolfsson, Tom Mitchell, and Daniel Rock,</v>

111
00:10:55.142 --> 00:10:58.023
<v Daniel>they all calculated theoretical exposure.</v>

112
00:10:58.263 --> 00:10:58.743
<v Maya>Theoretical.</v>

113
