154
00:15:24.194 --> 00:15:33.838
<v Daniel>editing is just a minor sub-step of a much larger, highly specific goal. Like preparing a quarterly regional sales report or drafting a legal brief for a tort case.</v>

155
00:15:34.217 --> 00:15:48.882
