156
00:15:49.182 --> 00:15:50.022
<v Maya>the actual menu.</v>

157
00:15:50.202 --> 00:15:58.005
<v Daniel>Exactly. And because of this generic task trap, the chat log data becomes wildly concentrated. The paper provides a stunning metric on this.</v>

158
00:15:58.125 --> 00:15:58.525
<v Maya>Let's hear it.</v>

159
00:15:58.985 --> 00:16:05.170
<v Daniel>The top 10 generic tasks take up 46 to 61% of all chat usage in the platform logs.</v>

160
00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:05.931
<v Maya>Huge chunk.</v>

161
00:16:06.471 --> 00:16:12.817
